rong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\u00a0<\/span><a style=\"text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"http:\/\/www.allocine.fr\/seance\/salle_gen_csalle=P7908.html\"><strong><span style=\"color: #339966; text-decoration: underline;\">cin\u00e9 plan\u00e9te<\/span><\/strong><\/a><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">,<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>\u00e0 St Donat sur l&rsquo;Herbasse<\/strong><\/span>:<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #339966; text-decoration: underline;\"> cin\u00e9ma salle espace des collines<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Ballade, p\u00eache, pique nique au bord de l&rsquo;eau..<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\u00e0 <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"http:\/\/www.peyrins.fr\/fr\/information\/34553\/les-lacs-bellevue-beach\"><strong><span style=\"color: #339966; text-decoration: underline;\">Peyrins,<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/span> en descendant sur<strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #339966;\"><a href=\"http:\/\/www.peyrins.fr\/fr\/information\/34555\/les-etangs-chalaire\"><span style=\"color: #339966; text-decoration: underline;\"> Romans sur Isere<\/span><\/a>\u00a0<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>&#8230; et se baigner.. <\/strong>pres de St Donat:<a href=\"http:\/\/www.lacdechampos.com\/\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #339966; text-decoration: underline;\"> lac de champos<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">.. \u00e0 bourg de P\u00e9age,<a href=\"http:\/\/www.ca-diabolo.fr\/\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #339966; text-decoration: underline;\">complexe aquatique<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/a>, \u00a0